        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vincent Kling, Hugo von Hofmannsthal\n- Organizations: Georg-August-Universität Göttingen, University of Vienna, Fulbright Program\n- Places: Germany\n- Topics: German literature\n\nFacts:\n- Hugo von Hofmannsthal was born on 1 February 1874 and died on 15 July 1929.\n- Hugo von Hofmannsthal was an Austrian prodigy, novelist, librettist, poet, dramatist, narrator, and essayist.\n- Vincent Kling is an American scholar and translator of German literature.\n- Vincent Kling's PhD thesis was based on the works of Hugo von Hofmannsthal.\n- Vincent Kling spent some time at Georg-August-Universität Göttingen in Germany.\n- Vincent Kling later taught at the University of Vienna under a Fulbright scholarship.",
